ght:2px; margin:0 1px; background-color:#fafbfc;"></div></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="background-color:#fafbfc;padding:7px 11px;border-radius:8px;"><div style="font-family:Inter,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.8px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f1728;margin-bottom:8px;">Ship From</div><div style="font-family:Inter,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;line-height:18px;color:#344054;word-wrap:break-word;"><b style="color:#0f1728;">{!RelatedTo.Axolt__Distribution_Channel__r.Name}</b><br/>{!$Organization.Name} &#183; {!RelatedTo.Axolt__Distribution_Channel__r.Axolt__Site__r.Name}<br/>{!RelatedTo.Axolt__Distribution_Channel__r.Axolt__Site__r.Axolt__Address__r.Axolt__Address_Line1__c}<br/>{!RelatedTo.Axolt__Distribution_Channel__r.Axolt__Site__r.Axolt__Address__r.Axolt__City__c}, {!RelatedTo.Axolt__Distribution_Channel__r.Axolt__Site__r.Axolt__Address__r.Axolt__State__c} {!RelatedTo.Axolt__Distribution_Channel__r.Axolt__Site__r.Axolt__Address__r.Axolt__Postal_Code__c}<br/><b style="color:#0f1728;">From Channel:</b> {!RelatedTo.Axolt__Channel__r.Name}</div></td><td width="16" style="width:16px; padding:0; font-size:1px; line-height:1px;">&#160;</td><td valign="top" style="background-color:#fafbfc;padding:7px 11px;border-radius:8px;"><div style="font-family:Inter,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.8px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f1728;margin-bottom:8px;">Ship To</div><div style="font-family:Inter,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;line-height:18px;color:#344054;word-wrap:break-word;"><b style="color:#0f1728;">{!RelatedTo.Axolt__To_Distribution_Channel__r.Name}</b><br/>{!$Organization.Name} &#183; {!RelatedTo.Axolt__To_Distribution_Channel__r.Axolt__Site__r.Name}<br/>{!RelatedTo.Axolt__To_Distribution_Channel__r.Axolt__Site__r.Axolt__Address__r.Axolt__Address_Line1__c}<br/>{!RelatedTo.Axolt__To_Distribution_Channel__r.Axolt__Site__r.Axolt__Address__r.Axolt__City__c}, {!RelatedTo.Axolt__To_Distribution_Channel__r.Axolt__Site__r.Axolt__Address__r.Axolt__State__c} {!RelatedTo.Axolt__To_Distribution_Channel__r.Axolt__Site__r.Axolt__Address__r.Axolt__Postal_Code__c}<br/><b style="color:#0f1728;">To Channel:</b> {!RelatedTo.Axolt__To_Channel__r.Name}</div></td><td width="16" style="width:16px; padding:0; font-size:1px; line-height:1px;">&#160;</td><td valign="top" style="background-color:#fafbfc;padding:7px 11px;border-radius:8px;"><div style="font-family:Inter,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.8px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f1728;margin-bottom:8px;">Receiving Contact</div><div style="font-family:Inter,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;line-height:18px;color:#344054;word-wrap:break-word;">{!RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Name}<br/>{!RelatedTo.Axolt__To_Distribution_Channel__r.Name}<br/><apex:outputText value="{!RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email}" rendered="{!CONTAINS(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email, ' ')}"/><apex:outputText value="{!LEFT(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email, 24)}" rendered="{!NOT(CONTAINS(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email, ' '))}"/><apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!AND(NOT(CONTAINS(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email, ' ')), LEN(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email) > 24)}"><br/><apex:outputText value="{!MID(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email, 25, 24)}"/></apex:outputPanel><apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!AND(NOT(CONTAINS(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email, ' ')), LEN(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email) > 48)}"><br/><apex:outputText value="{!MID(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email, 49, 24)}"/></apex:outputPanel><apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!AND(NOT(CONTAINS(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email, ' ')), LEN(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email) > 72)}"><br/><apex:outputText value="{!MID(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email, 73, 24)}"/></apex:outputPanel><apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!AND(NOT(CONTAINS(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email, ' ')), LEN(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email) > 96)}"><br/><apex:outputText value="{!MID(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email, 97, 24)}"/></apex:outputPanel><apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!AND(NOT(CONTAINS(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email, ' ')), LEN(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email) > 120)}"><br/><apex:outputText value="{!MID(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email, 121, 24)}"/></apex:outputPanel><apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!AND(NOT(CONTAINS(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email, ' ')), LEN(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email) > 144)}"><br/><apex:outputText value="{!MID(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email, 145, 24)}"/></apex:outputPanel><apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!AND(NOT(CONTAINS(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email, ' ')), LEN(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email) > 168)}"><br/><apex:outputText value="{!MID(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email, 169, 24)}"/></apex:outputPanel><apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!AND(NOT(CONTAINS(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email, ' ')), LEN(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email) > 192)}"><br/><apex:outputText value="{!MID(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email, 193, 24)}"/></apex:outputPanel><apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!AND(NOT(CONTAINS(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email, ' ')), LEN(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email) > 216)}"><br/><apex:outputText value="{!MID(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email, 217, 24)}"/></apex:outputPanel><apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!AND(NOT(CONTAINS(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email, ' ')), LEN(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email) > 240)}"><br/><apex:outputText value="{!MID(RelatedTo.Axolt__Contact__r.Email, 241, 32000)}"/></apex:outputPanel></div></td></tr><tr class="tcap" style="display:none;"><td style="padding:0;"><div style="display:block; font-size:1px; line-height:1px; overflow:hidden; height:2px; margin:0 1px; background-color:#fafbfc;"></div>